	"overview": {
		"goal": {
			"en": "Store private memories, tags, versions and attachments through scoped REST and MCP APIs, with an Access-protected admin dashboard. External bots perform migration, deduplication and summaries; Vectorize is a derived index, not the source of truth.",
			"zh": "通过带作用域的 REST 与 MCP API 保存私人记忆、标签、版本和附件，管理工作台由 Access 保护。迁移、去重和摘要由外部 bot 完成；Vectorize 是派生索引，而非数据源。"
		},
